+# pt2-clone-amix
+
+**pt2-clone for AMIX** (Commodore's Amiga UNIX) on a 68060, with sound through
+Paula itself (`/dev/paula`). See [amix/README.md](amix/README.md) for what's
+different, how to build and how to run it.
+
+The original pt2-clone by Olav Sørensen (8bitbubsy) is at
+<https://github.com/8bitbubsy/pt2-clone>; this repository starts from its commit
+18954f2. Upstream's README follows unchanged.
+
+---
+
 # pt2-clone
 ProTracker 2 clone for Windows/macOS/Linux
 
